//sha-256;BqtwXFhYvE6nRkQoCpz2LAhCUe3r39yw6mc32wn0Qj8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka2ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zKn84YBaos0q-8hl5Y912Jg-not7VAP7IwUxLIW07CQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke32000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PgsuX-ElySYi8KgGuSq-1mppSjrrdy_lUwp0_Tds1RIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd4777ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4NCmY1AHYPue-pajqvqfg80429lQ6e_1e288VYWv_aEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ITCeYxFsosSquuGWq0M2GZCug-969XYz70fJE6kgQUgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eOPbMcRo8DeQOBWEf65IUEan3P6Cry4Wpmop5ysvjVMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Y3QoB9XysjH93d-zB4qvxfuMnTh6JasHcq7BaBiB0J0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyøThe Editor identifies three material defects: the description field, the summary field, and the final section's double attribution from a single context item. The description and summary are metadata fields outside the prose body and cannot appear in the body output under the no-frontmatter constraint; the only body-level repair is the final section. I will compress the two context-1 attributed facts into one and preserve everything else byte-for-byte.

