stant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xmAC6-LHqmPIipESpyMUpwQhBrfUacZE6dIqWWmElEAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;pYcsUEUvWznHidxpANszlYWxyD_W_JX3LtE0fskrInkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iwv9rC_1hVO8UkfkMpz4nTS5S5VByl8t57-CHbB8Mf4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PHLSfjsPwCYQdIiPYwMaCK-Uu_LAW5qeWQJS8JmoMYUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhstandardƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ISVvB3xqfWzjl35usLs5pnhJxUA73_p545yRisOiLWoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhstandardƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YbcjvxWXipl5lscztaumFL6y0Tza_OWUu9hk7l-xZF0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx$b0df25d5-3fdf-4f51-9a25-4de0809d9635ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;TNYi7BIS0kPyYumFub_H6b1XN24kxoJjUHtXoe2qsycƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyøThe Editor identifies three material defects: the description field, the summary field, and the final section's double attribution from a single context item. The description and summary are metadata fields outside the prose body and cannot appear in the body output under the no-frontmatter constraint; the only body-level repair is the final section. I will compress the two context-1 attributed facts into one and preserve everything else byte-for-byte.

